      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Nipponbashi, nicknamed Den Den Town, once focused on electrical appliances but now hosts major video‑game companies like Capcom and SNK.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
